0.0,"total_cash_per_share":33.536,"total_debt":823593984.0,"debt_to_equity":25.589,"current_ratio":1.545,"enterprise_value":14235357184.0,"enterprise_to_ebitda":7.888,"enterprise_to_revenue":0.994,"earnings_growth":0.74,"shares_outstanding":18007392.0,"float_shares":5318532.0,"held_pct_insiders":0.75385004,"held_pct_institutions":0.0,"fifty_two_week_high":1639.0,"fifty_two_week_low":761.05,"fifty_day_average":900.844,"two_hundred_day_avg":1254.4353,"recommendation":"none","all_time_high":1639.0,"all_time_low":740.0,"long_business_summary":"Rajesh Power Services Limited provides engineering, procurement, and construction contracting and services to power transmission and distribution utilities companies in India. The company undertakes turnkey projects for EHV cables and transmission lines, EHV substations, MV/HV/LV distribution systems, and solar projects; and offers operation and maintenance services for EHV substations and solar plants. It also provides utility services, including underground cable fault location and rectification of EHV/MV/HV/LV networks; replacement/retrofitting of transformers and switch gears; cable laying and jointing; and substation maintenance and up keeping. In addition, the company offers testing of switch yard equipment, such as power transformers scheme testing, tan delta measurement, contact resistance measurement of EHV isolators and breakers, primary injection testing of CTs, and relay testing, as well as EHV/MV/HV/LV cable testing services. Further, it provides EHV cable system design and substation design; design of distribution networks, selection of cable size, transformer rating, calculation of voltage drop, and calculation of losses in distribution networks; site survey and preparation of detailed project report; consultancy for electrical projects; and inspection services for equipment. Rajesh Power Services Limited was founded in 1971 and is based in Ahmedabad, India."}}